== Walkthrough ==

Joogl Honeybugger is located at (-852, -2264).

You say, 'Hail, Joogl Honeybugger'

: Joogl Honeybugger says 'Hello.  I would shake your hand, but it would [hurt].  Ooooh! Owwy!'

You say, 'What hurts?'

: Joogl Honeybugger says 'I was attacked by the bixies.  They swarmed on me!!  I think I got too near their queen.  I need that honey to make a living!  Get me a bandage and I will tell you where all their worker bees buzz around.'

Give him 1 x [[Bandages]] (see '''Notes''' below)

: Joogl Honeybugger says 'Oh thank you, ______.  If you are ever going to gather bixie honeycombs pray you do not run into the queen.  The only way I know of collecting the honey is by intercepting the drones and taking the honeycombs they sometimes carry.  Good luck !!'
