'''Notes:''' 
*  You can hand in 100 bandages at a time (stacked) and get 100 sets of faction hits.
*  This quest can be done as an Iksar Monk.  Stand at the window closest to Joogl, duck, and move in really close to the window.  Sneak.  Once you're indifferent, give him the Bandages. (Alternatively, ask a druid for Wolf Form, and you will con indifferent.) After 556 turn in I'm now dubious to Joogl.
*  This quest when done as a KOS Iksar Shaman required wolf form brining me to Apprehensive. Tested without wolf form and he accepts bandages at Dubious. 
*  As an Iksar monk, it me took 1152 bandages (57 stacks +12) to get indifferent, and another 100 to get to amiable. This resulted in amiable with most guards, and warmly with most merchants - however Ella Foodcrafter and the cleric guild remained KoS (as expected) 07/02/26


